 Important notes

    The script uses password_hash() for user passwords.

    All generated users have the test password Password123!.

    Customer IDs and category IDs are collected automatically and used when generating orders and products.

    Images are placeholder paths. You need to create the corresponding image files if you want them to display.

    The script adds records each time you run it. Because usernames and emails are unique, running it again may cause a duplicate-entry error. Use a fresh database or clear the test records first.

My recommendation: Keep these two files separate:

    script.php — creates all database tables.

    populate.php — generates Faker data and inserts sample records.

